---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+16072289269";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (607) 228-9269";
---
<Layout title="AC Blowing Warm Air Gastonia NC | Not Cooling | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="AC running but blowing warm air in Gastonia? Low refrigerant or compressor failure. Same-day emergency service. Call +1 (607) 228-9269.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/problems/">Problems</a> / Blowing Warm Air</p>
      <h1>AC Blowing Warm Air in Gastonia</h1>
      <p>If your AC runs but blows warm, refrigerant is likely low or your compressor is failing. In Gastonia summers, this is a true emergency.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p><span class="badge badge-danger">Urgent — Act Now</span></p>
      <p>Warm air from the vents while the outdoor unit runs usually means the refrigeration cycle is not removing heat properly. Causes include low refrigerant (leak), failed compressor, stuck reversing valve (heat pumps), or a condenser blocked by debris.</p>
      <p>Continued operation under these conditions can overheat the compressor. Same-day diagnosis is recommended. Related services: <a href="/services/refrigerant-leak-repair/">Refrigerant Leak Repair</a>, <a href="/services/compressor-repair/">Compressor Repair</a>, <a href="/services/emergency-ac-repair/">Emergency AC Repair</a>.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
